{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_01",
      "hash": "7a4c10300efd7ddb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The game in which Pokémon fly in the sky...\\nIt’s great, isn’t it?\\c\\nIf we could fly in real life, that would be much\\ncooler than the game, though!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_02",
      "hash": "7a4c11300efd7f8e",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh! You’re curious, aren’t you?\\nYou’re curious about me and this machine!\\c\\nDo you want to know the details?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_03",
      "hash": "7a4c12300efd8141",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_04",
      "hash": "7a4c13300efd82f4",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK. If you insist.\\nThis machine is..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_05",
      "hash": "7a4c14300efd84a7",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "a great vehicle that allows you to fly in the sky!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_06",
      "hash": "7a4c15300efd865a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It’s a marvelous invention, if I do say so myself!\\nIt’s not an exaggeration to say that this is\\r\\na [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_07",
      "hash": "7a4c16300efd880d",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Even though I worked really hard on this,\\nnobody wants to try it..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_08",
      "hash": "7a4c07300efd6e90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...You seem to be a courageous young [VAR GENDBR(00FF,0403)]boygirl.\\c\\nI’ll tell you how to ride this machine—\\nthe [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique Sky Dash[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_09",
      "hash": "7a4c08300efd7043",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh?! That [VAR POKNAME(0002)] wants to fly\\nmy invention instead of you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_10",
      "hash": "7a4f15300effbc31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Great!\\nIt matches my inspiration perfectly!\\r\\nAll right! Let’s get right to it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_11",
      "hash": "7a4f14300effba7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do this and that...\\nHold this handle, and pull!\\c\\nThen, that will be like that...\\nAnd with these balloons, you’re in the air!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_01",
      "hash": "18c58e2029345768",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] learned the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]Sky Dash[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub072_sys_02",
      "hash": "18c5912029345c81",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Use the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique Sky Dash[VAR COLOR(0000)], and\\nyou can fly to a town you’ve been to.\\c\\nSelect Play with [VAR PKNICK(0003)] in\\nthe main menu, then select Secret Techniques."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_12",
      "hash": "7a4f13300effb8cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You can have this machine, so be sure to enjoy\\nmany trips through the sky!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub072_denkigroup_13",
      "hash": "7a4f12300effb718",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Are you enjoying Sky Dash?\\nWhat kind of machine shall I make next?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub072_child_m_01",
      "hash": "1da1b925a9413f05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
